  "body": "Eco-friendly paradise in the heart of Browns Bay.\r\n3 dwellings on one title\r\n5-STAR POTENTIAL\r\n\r\nSPACIOUS\r\n1027 sq m section \r\nMain house of 168 sq m:\r\nwith 3-4 bedrooms:\r\none downstairs with wheelchair-friendly access and ensuite - plus another bathroom upstairs:\r\nPLUS - extra income?\r\nFully self-contained minor dwelling of 120 sq.m:\r\n1-2 bedrooms:\r\nwith double garage and workshop underneath which has the plumbing etc set up for another 2-bedroom flat as above.\r\n\r\nTRANQUIL - private and peaceful - flat patio area in stable bank of bush that markedly freshens the air.\r\n\r\nFLAT ACCESS to Browns Bay beach and all amenities:\r\nshops, buses, library, RSA & bowls, Racquet Club, parks:\r\nMaintain mobility and independence for elderly or disabled members of the family.\r\nIntergenerational and multi-puporse.\r\n\r\nECO-friendly design by architect Reinhardt Kanuka Fuchs of the Building, Biology & Ecology Institute.\r\nEnhanced with \r\nHEAT PUMP for underfloor heating\r\nSOLAR panels and batteries\r\nHRV ventilation\r\nHeavenly WATER FACTORY - with marine-grade stainless steel RAIN water tanks:\r\nGrundfos pump - good fire protection!\r\nTriple-filtered and UV treated.\r\nProductive ORGANIC GARDEN and mature FRUIT TREES - include banana, feijoa, plums, guava, figs, grapes & blackberries - thornless of course!\r\nPotting shed\r\nRustic Gazebo - now demolished  . . .  :{\r\n\r\nAlso:\r\nCCTV\r\nUnderfloor heating\r\nHome Security system if required.\r\n\r\nThis is an exceptional property that we bought because of the wheelchair access - which is rare in the ups and downs of East Coast Bays - and didn't fully realise the other superb benefits until we got to live in it.\r\n\r\nIt is presently being remodelled and renovated, so there is a chance to put your own stamp on it, and negotiate a great price.\r\n\r\nPhone OWNER\r\nTricia\r\n027 469 2233\r\n\r\nAgents welcome to find a buyer:\r\nA 'finders fee' is offered to others.",
